lint-range` over the PR commit range. `test` gates `check` so a broken rule never lands silently.\n\nAccepted forms: `Fixes #N`, `Updates #N`, cross-repo refs (`org/repo#N`), full GitHub issue URLs, plus the full `tailscale/issuebot` verb set. Skip tokens: `[bot]` authors, `Revert` subjects, `#cleanup` lines, `skip-issuebot`. All documented in `CONTRIBUTING.md`.\n\nBranch protection on `main` needs a manual flip to require `Commit Lint / check` once this lands.\n\n> Generated with the help of an AI assistant","created_at":"2026-04-29T13:50:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T17:21:29Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3231/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3231/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3231/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/statuses/519a2b1d1a80a1731caac2956ffd0aa7ea737a02","head":{"label":"kradalby:commit-issue-refs","ref":"commit-issue-refs","sha":"519a2b1d1a80a1731caac2956ffd0aa7ea737a02","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/or